  </div>

  <div class="row g-4">
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm">
        <div class="card-body p-4">
          <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <div class="feature-icon-badge m-0">📖</div>
            <h4 class="card-title fw-bold text-primary m-0">Dr. G.R.D. Memorial Library</h4>
          </div>
          <p class="small text-muted">
            Spanning over 2.5 lakh volumes, 350+ printed journals, IEEE/ACM digital libraries, and 24/7 high-speed Wi-Fi access. Equipped with RFID book issue and automated kiosks.
          </p>
          <ul class="small list-unstyled">
            <li>⏰ <strong>Working Hours:</strong> Mon - Sat: 8:00 AM to 10:00 PM</li>
