          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-6">
      <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm">
        <div class="card-body p-4">
          <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <div class="feature-icon-badge m-0">🏠</div>
            <h4 class="card-title fw-bold text-primary m-0">Student Hostels (Boys & Girls)</h4>
          </div>
          <p class="small text-muted">
            Separate well-furnished hostel blocks with hygienic mechanized kitchens, solar water heaters, indoor recreation rooms, and round-the-clock medical care.
