          <div class="p-3 bg-light rounded small border">
            <strong>Hostel Safety Regulations:</strong>
            <ul class="mb-0 mt-1">
              <li>In-Time is strictly <strong>8:30 PM</strong> with biometric verification.</li>
              <li>Outing / Leave permissions must be pre-approved via digital forms.</li>
              <li>Chief Warden Office: <strong>0422-4344777</strong></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-6">
      <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm">
        <div class="card-body p-4">
          <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <div class="feature-icon-badge m-0">⚽</div>
            <h4 class="card-title fw-bold text-primary m-0">Sports & Gymnasium Complex</h4>
          </div>
          <p class="small text-muted">
            Synthetic basketball courts, tennis courts, floodlit volleyball arenas, football grounds, indoor badminton stadium, and modernized multi-station gymnasium.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-6">
      <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm">
        <div class="card-body p-4">
          <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <div class="feature-icon-badge m-0">☕</div>
            <h4 class="card-title fw-bold text-primary m-0">Cafeteria & Health Centre</h4>
          </div>
          <p class="small text-muted">
            Multi-cuisine hygienic canteens serving nutritious vegetarian and non-vegetarian food. The campus health center has resident doctors and an emergency 24/7 ambulance.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
